canvas 520 300
label "Build pipeline: discover files, parse frontmatter, validate against the schema, resolve links, emit the graph, the search index, the pages, the discovery document and the NOW page, then build twice and compare bytes (highlighted) before www/ is published"
caption "The highlighted double build is the proof of determinism: two builds must agree byte for byte before anything is published."
box discover 16 40 96 44 "discover|files"
box parse 128 40 96 44 "parse|frontmatter"
box validate 240 40 96 44 "validate|schema"
box links 352 40 96 44 "resolve|links"
box graph 16 130 96 44 "graph|(RDF views)"
box index 128 130 96 44 "search|index"
box render 240 130 96 44 "render|pages"
box disc 352 130 96 44 "discovery|document"
box now 16 220 96 44 "NOW page"
box verify 128 220 140 44 "build twice,|compare bytes" acc
box out 300 220 200 44 "www/ — published as committed"
arrow discover parse
arrow parse validate
arrow validate links
arrow links graph via=400,107;64,107
arrow graph index
arrow index render
arrow render disc
arrow disc now via=400,197;64,197
arrow now verify
arrow verify out
note "every step is deterministic; the double build is the proof"
